Condensed tannin: Tannin was determined by Burns et al.,[32]

The mushroom samples were cleaned out of forest debris (without
washing) with a plastic knife and sliced without separating the cap and
the stipe of the mushrooms. Samples were dried in drying oven in the
laboratory till constant weight. The dried samples were milled to fine
powder (20 mesh) using a mill (FW 100, Yusung Industrial Ltd, China)
and kept in plastic bottles until analysis.

Determination of minerals (major, minor and toxic)

