+
+- The source includes one canned A. bisporus sample; routing includes `products/canned-mushrooms` for that part but keeps the broader fresh/wild mushroom evidence separate in `matrices`.
+- Cd non-detect notation is copied from the table as ND (<0.028), while the narrative also states "<0.03 ug/g"; these are equivalent at the reported precision.

