+- [[products/mushrooms]]
+- [[metals/lead]]
+- [[metals/cadmium]]
+- [[metals/arsenic-total]]
+- [[metals/mercury-total]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+- Arsenic is total As; no inorganic arsenic speciation is reported.
+- Mercury is total Hg; no methylmercury speciation is reported.
