+- [[ingredients/mushrooms]]
+- [[products/mushrooms]]
+- [[metals/mercury-total]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+- The DOI and publication metadata are printed in the PDF.
+- The source reports total Hg only; this page does not infer methylmercury.
